{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "aa45063a3636119256062c3c64e5030f5b41abbc3a6e61baba912887a884c7f5", "ja": "方向性の違い！", "zh": "音乐理念不合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2343d28e56028ba30128a146d2e6fd7da1dd48a8223a591e53e011efd696938b", "ja": "JCC実行委員会から衣装サンプルが届き、\n早速試着するメンバー。予想外の衣装に\n莉緒は「方向性が全然違う！」と焦り、\n似合っていると言われても信じず、プロデュ\nーサーは莉緒の新しい一面を見たと感じる。", "zh": "JCC实行委员会送来了服装样品，\n成员们立刻进行了试穿。面对出人意料的服装，\n莉绪焦急地表示“方向性完全不对！”，\n就算被夸很合适也不相信，制作人\n则觉得自己看到了莉绪崭新的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2835ca1acf2415a2040dec65437ab5a35ae9dde97e11f810f3ae5fbee6666043", "ja": "（公演とショー、同時進行だと慌ただしいな。\n今日はこの後、みんなとミーティングだけど……）", "zh": "（公演和秀场同时进行，真是忙得不可开交。今天接下来还要和大家开会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1001_se", "source_sha256": "17b7d4465251f58898169f5fde71a4781937a5ef4054f5e5b5b9b0a979e7e786", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャッ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "1598de79b72ca1f3d7c53ef6b90e480572bb95290c64c8b3d08bd0f78dc369dc", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です！\n今からミーティングですよね？　えへへ、よかったぁ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n现在正要开会吧？诶嘿嘿，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "7d6c66b969115872e2853d98ded6442441d60d589088d246de5b4065a1d76d0b", "ja": "JCC実行委員会から衣装のサンプルが届きましたよ！\nきっと、みんな楽しみにしてると思って。", "zh": "JCC执行委员会把服装的样品送过来了哦！\n我想着，大家肯定都很期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "dcf05da44b4bb848edea69edd5826e367ccd45d0b712164413e264150a1aa510", "ja": "あっ、本当ですか？\nありがとうございます、すぐにチェックを……。", "zh": "啊，真的吗？\n谢谢您，我马上确认……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3b4c86be97231dbb21512f58272a3fc68440841408aa731bfc8ed733d969f90b", "ja": "そうだ。青羽さん、お時間大丈夫でしたら、\n同席してもらっていいですか？", "zh": "对了。青羽小姐，如果您时间方便的话，可以请您一起参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "68a5d0c91972318d786607f82c78ccd8d04fb17cc14b0750d4ad422e10457e54", "ja": "わぁ、いいんですか！？\nやったー♪", "zh": "哇，可以吗！？\n太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1007_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "179a63306f8c4724b00134b34e462239a2e32fe14af91b2946b64598241f94b6", "ja": "ええ～～～っ！！？\nこ、これって……！", "zh": "诶诶～～～！！？\n这、这就是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "d56e0b2fe1627fe316f6b4c8e6219dc5667c4be0fde803f07b15ad2d50951488", "ja": "おいおい、マジかよ……。本当にこれが、\nウチらの衣装なのか？　{$P$}。", "zh": "喂喂，真的假的……这真的是我们要穿的服装吗？{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5d52c8239ecf72b636f4e39b31bd9c45f7ec8bc76fc15d8d1fa05e969f448954", "ja": "ああ、間違いない。ガーリーでフェミニンな雰囲気で、\n販売ターゲットの年齢層は前回より少し低め……。", "zh": "啊，没错。整体氛围偏少女风和女性化，\n销售目标的年龄层比上次稍微低一些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7699e4d796b973cbc48a7c7c86172b33c8a441a04d48ddc99509b1a5290eb956", "ja": "お財布にも優しい価格帯の、\n日常使いできる可愛らしいファッションって聞いてる。", "zh": "听说是价格对钱包比较友好的、适合日常穿着的可爱风时装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "b8921ac5754aeeebbd88c86e4a35423f7d23d1686ca7b8980ab92165abd713b3", "ja": "いわゆる、『量産型』『地雷系』と呼ばれる\nファッションに近いかも……？　今どきですね！", "zh": "可能比较接近所谓的“量产型”和“地雷系”\n风格……？真有现代感呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "9f4ca6f8262b3493b013095afa2a9eeefc94ed9b300fd6772ff12a686bb1ec88", "ja": "みんな、すごいなぁ♪　届いたばっかりの\n衣装なのに、もう着こなしちゃって！", "zh": "大家真厉害呀♪ 明明是刚送到的\n服装，却已经穿得这么有模有样了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "4692816cb07fc16429899e18e84d86c3fd86827bcb4fd63e0eccf7443a25c63c", "ja": "なるほど、こうくるとは思いませんでした～。\nJCCさんは、なかなかの策士ですな～。", "zh": "原来如此，没想到会是这样的展开～  \nJCC先生还真是个厉害的谋士呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "bdcbb2652ee3f88c8a84d14a6f2b246e4b4fae37c922eaf813016ccd3ea03de2", "ja": "ちょっと意外だったけど。\nでも、普段使いできるってコンセプトはいいと思うな。", "zh": "虽然有点出乎意料。\n不过，我觉得“日常也能使用”这个理念挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "68c44d7b2a9a6cedf6de2ae7db8996392fa6f22c5dc82a2130e9febba5162f0f", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと、{$P$}く～ん！\nこういう方向性だって、聞いてないわよ～！？", "zh": "等等等等，{$P$}！我可没听说会朝这个方向发展啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8a0c75ae44e4c1508ec5ba22f2572264a966bd566a9ba6f31fc45a2e4be905c3", "ja": "えっ。莉緒、何か問題があるのか？\nあんなに、やる気も自信も満々だったのに……？", "zh": "咦。莉绪，难道有什么问题吗？\n明明之前还干劲十足、信心满满的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "192f99322d3072987430fefd563abc285a956d8bc01cf95b72d57842cdaa0881", "ja": "だ、だって～……！\nいつもの私と、方向性が全然違うじゃない！？", "zh": "可、可是～……！\n这和一贯的我，方向完全不一样嘛！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "bd00623180bbc7e66592843be80d04d272f96a58aae46717b87922d0a24d4195", "ja": "えっ……そうかな？\nそんなに違うか……？", "zh": "诶……是这样吗？\n有那么不一样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "77313955bd9a819511cb261e8c25e76f2cb35fc4079140186f01bfb0c1f6a4c0", "ja": "違うわよ～！！！　セクシー系とか、大人っぽい\n衣装なら問題ないけど、こういうのは……うぅ～。", "zh": "不一样啦～！！！性感风或者成熟风的服装倒是没问题，可这种……呜呜～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "f945c3243df80456d56b2eb9a76867e18f378380dfc8b64de54e6626e8307568", "ja": "ふむふむ……。莉緒さん、動揺してますね～。\nこれは、もしかして……。", "zh": "嗯嗯……莉绪小姐好像很慌张呢～。这莫非是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "80046627819b3a5475d60e4833fc3677f79cd7794c57c24ca2ded368f81c92c1", "ja": "もしかして、チャンスかも？　あはっ。", "zh": "说不定，是个机会哦？啊哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "7aa577c45a60b482e2ba6919b67941f046d5a8927e6626edcaf7ddfc30430e7e", "ja": "こりゃ、あたしにも勝ち目があるかもな……？\n莉緒姉には悪いけど、真剣勝負だし。", "zh": "这样看来，说不定我也有胜算……？\n虽然对莉绪姐有点过意不去，但毕竟是认真较量嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "22ddf17fd2981f91cadcb27095ef86b52bec99d8c49b99e4d86159344e774702", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと、みんな～！？", "zh": "等等等等，大家～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "89955ef49ba2ebc86af8cfcd2bb13c737ad1d93a5ea8637d9c2ee5f10b80276a", "ja": "私は以前、真さんとドラマのお仕事で、\nこういう感じの衣装を着ましたから～。", "zh": "我以前和真一起做电视剧的工作时，\n也穿过这种感觉的服装呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "413ec9aced4831f54e9e9e983b1f215804b4d9f021eb9114fa5a07c5a6bed156", "ja": "その時も、「似合ってる」って褒めてもらえて、\nとってもうれしかったんですよ～。ふふふ。", "zh": "那时候也有人夸我“很适合”，我特别开心呢～。呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "902ae8efc30f90e497be9cb41fd62247fb1f2045473168ad71d4e1e352d65d74", "ja": "あれは、真のバンドのファン役だったか……\n言われてみれば、方向性は似てるな。", "zh": "那次是演真的乐队的粉丝来着吧……\n经你这么一说，风格确实挺像的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "3f095d607f55ba4117e84ff242e996ca4004e3b710982b96bee9870b56d89fe9", "ja": "あたしも、こういう衣装には慣れてきたよ。\n誰かさんのせい……いや、お陰で、か？", "zh": "我也渐渐习惯这种服装了。都是因为某人……不，应该说多亏了某人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "b0116905c5157b615bf536620bdea3b78f6b0d0b51e5d88ac793c83d2919e131", "ja": "前なんか、美希とお姫様までやったし。\n少し違うかもだけど……ま、似たようなもんだろ！", "zh": "之前还和美希一起演过公主呢。可能有点不一样……不过，差不多就是那么回事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "63570d5c77b49a7e1dc7a57df578572399900ecd3db2b23db55cba53f2bf5683", "ja": "ミキは苦手な衣装とかないし、フツーに\nやるだけかな。えーと、この雰囲気だったら……。", "zh": "美希没有不擅长穿的服装，所以应该就是普通地做吧。呃，按照这种感觉的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "71b8152097f27f6559daacf3221f64c8d2103ca731bda42b02fba4ed0ddd45e3", "ja": "こんなカンジ？\n目を逸らしちゃ、ヤ！なの。あはっ☆", "zh": "是这种感觉？\n移开视线的话，不行哦！啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "478600206540d52460871a1286500e57a41fd5d3acbd23e0574a362ab3740fcb", "ja": "なによ～、私だけアウェイじゃない！？\n{$P$}くん、話が違うわよ～！", "zh": "什么嘛～，怎么只有我一个人被排除在外！？\n{$P$}，这和说好的不一样呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "ba557c2f760e088173de3cd3e2933b1bb8e17f099641b20bece590c333186e0c", "ja": "いや……別に普通に着たらいいんじゃないか？\nファッションなんだし……。", "zh": "哎……其实照常穿不就好了吗？\n反正也是时尚嘛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "b2bd96bd8cf9ea7a4114f129780ea2a6674a9e0e81e3bebd0e0bc8ff3b678e67", "ja": "そういうことじゃないのよ～っ、も～～～っ！！", "zh": "不是那个意思啦～真是的～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "556bd39519fd8faac6187ca47e9354a9bba71632d66eefb5a64f4ba3c75d3cc5", "ja": "セクシーとか、露出度が高いのはいいの！\nこういうほうが、かえって恥ずかしいの！", "zh": "性感或者暴露度高一点都没关系！\n反而是这种，更让人害羞啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "ad7a228309b540d62a1ffa975a7021a19e9b7e19b11e1fe8e9c4b683b95d4e6b", "ja": "おお……？\n莉緒姉のこういう反応、なんだか新鮮だな。", "zh": "哦……？\n莉绪姐这样的反应，总觉得很新鲜啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1037_042miy", "source_sha256": "4e43d2620c48777a958f101d75414c46f4481a992b9a70d68293d22129836c6d", "ja": "はい～、なんだかとっても可愛らしいですよ～。\nこれはこれで……？", "zh": "是呀～总觉得特别可爱呢～  \n这样也挺好的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1038_102mis", "source_sha256": "1dce37c11d01e08eb544129040dc099f55ef695b39995ec91da1a2e3bffb4ed9", "ja": "莉緒さん、大丈夫です！　とっても似合ってますよ！\nこのフリルとか……。", "zh": "莉緒小姐，没事的！非常适合您哦！\n这个荷叶边什么的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1039_046rio", "source_sha256": "43de55a4604ea017a5232f4fccc7f08401e7bc3ec35942e179ca0bec9aff5c4b", "ja": "いや～～～っ！！！\nウソウソ、絶対似合ってないもの～～～っ！！！", "zh": "不要啊～～～！！！\n骗人骗人，绝对一点都不适合啦～～～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1040_p", "source_sha256": "802abebaa45645b385d0a6092150746abfe2da927670e33e18b6f3db5ef37833", "ja": "（うーん……。莉緒は何故か\n似合わないと思い込んでるみたいだけど、寧ろ……）", "zh": "（嗯……。莉绪不知为何好像认定自己不适合，不过，倒不如说……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_02_1041_003mik", "source_sha256": "6844fbd9d88e89d206ba7c2822bbfc935bbd1fc92c0d466141a71a212464ec9f", "ja": "{$P$}？\n何だか、悪い顔してる……あやしいの～。", "zh": "{$P$}？\n总觉得，你的表情好坏哦……好可疑哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
